@overheard watch
// Writer (command), batch 3c. The Watch: patrol pairs, the night rounds, Holt's lectures.

== overheard
? pair:chief+junior dept:watch
A: Nearest suit locker. Don't look.
B: Behind the... second door?
A: Hm. Adequate.   #funny

? pair:chief+junior dept:watch deck:2
A: Hatches. Why do we check them twice?
B: Once is luck. Twice is the job.
A: Who told you that?
B: You did. Tuesday.   #funny

? pair:watch+watch time:night
A: Deck 4, all quiet.
B: Pell's talking in his sleep again.
A: Engines?
B: Engines.   #funny

? pair:watch+watch time:morning
A: Did the Chief laugh last night?
B: Mensah says twice.
A: Mensah always says twice.   #funny

? pair:watch+watch
A: Friendly on patrol.
B: Firm at the airlock.
A: Every day, that's the job.   #warm

? pair:watch+any deck:2
A: The Envoy's door's got a new knot.
B: How do you know?
A: The Chief counts them. Don't tell him I know.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 7: named pairs (who: is A, with: is B), placed where the talk belongs. Mostly not about work.
? pair:any+any who:mensah with:holt deck:2 time:night
A: Why did the airlock leave the hatch?
B: Don't.
A: Too many seals.
B: Hm.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:vasquez-uma with:holt deck:2
A: "A good Watch sees everything."
B: And says little, Vasquez.
A: Sorry, Chief. Little. Yes.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:garcia-greta with:kim-yusuf place:mess
A: Spare speaker wire?
B: Two metres. I'll trade you a jack.
A: Done. The night shift thanks you.

? pair:any+any who:park-noor with:lindqvist-isak place:musicroom
A: It's nine. The book's mine.
B: Nine-oh-two. You're late.
A: Then I keep it till eleven-oh-two.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:dahl-mira with:ueda-vera place:musicroom
A: Play it again, slower.
B: I'll be in bed by then.
A: Faster, then.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:achterberg-lars with:farouk-olu place:musicroom
A: It's "the long road home".
B: It's "the lone road home".
A: That's a different song.
B: It's a better one.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:chen-carmen with:amadi-asha time:morning deck:4
A: You went high on the last bit.
B: You went low. It worked.
A: Same again tomorrow?   #funny

? pair:any+any who:shah-dara with:volkov-maeve place:mess time:morning
A: You fixed it before I got here.
B: It beeped. I was nearby.
A: It beeps for me.
B: It beeps for everyone.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:ueda-vera with:varga-tariq place:mess
A: The post bag goes Thursday.
B: Mine's four pages.
A: Mine's two. I write small.
